# Audited: `Five` gives 5 whatever its dynamic, so the label is "pick 5".
# The tests of ts-ch04-plain-function-gives-whole-result-to-sigiled-parameter (Type System chapter 4).
emit Ui.*
use App.*

test gives_a_whole_result_to_a_sigiled_parameter, @shown:
    build
        => expect Ui.Label(text="pick 5")
